t selling ore pushes price down; with only 3 countries, 2 ore/turn is small.\n\nActually the econ panel said 矿场 回本≈22回合 (at plains 90金). At mountain 130金 → 32回合. Hmm, 80金+5木=90金折, output 4金/回合 → 22回合. Mountain: 120+5=130 → 32回合.\n\n黄金矿场 mountain: 300+10=310 → 31回合. Similar回本 but 黄金矿场 gives actual gold which I can't get otherwise without selling.\n\nKey difference: ore income requires market sales (price drops as I sell), gold is direct. Given I need gold to buy 装备/粮, 黄金矿场 is strategically better.\n\nBut 300金 now hurts. Compromise: build 黄金矿场 at 沃坝 this turn (it's the highest-value gold building), accept tight treasury. Actually let me reconsider — I could sell the 10 ore I hold now for ~40金.\n\nLet me do: build 4 things instead of 5 to save money? No — 每地块每回合限建1座, using all 5 is efficient.\n\nDecision turn 2:\n- 朔原 农场, 达川 农场, 霜塘 林场, 霜滩 林场, 沃坝 黄金矿场 = 534金, 25木\n- Sell 8 ore → +32金\n- Buy 15 wood → ~40金\n\nEnd: 946-534+32-40 = 404金, wood 35-25+15 = 25.\n\nTurn 3: 朔原 木材能源厂 (120金+15木) → 3位. 达川 林场 (57+5). 霜塘 林场#3 (57+5). 霜滩 at cap(木2)→ 农场? 霜滩 耕1 → 农场 (69+5). 沃坝 矿场 (120+5)? \nCost ~423金. Too much with 404 gold.\n\nLet me slow down. Turn 3: only 朔原能源厂(120) + 霜塘林场(57) = 177金. Keep buffer.\n\nHmm, I'm overthinking. Let me prioritize 兵营 path: 朔原 needs 3 buildings before barracks. Turn1 农场, Turn2 农场, Turn3 能源厂 → Turn4 兵营 → Turn5 active → recruit 2 armies turn 5 (I have 5装备+20粮... need 10粮5装 per army; can recruit 1 immediately, more after buying).\n\n达川 path to 2nd barracks: T1农场, T2农场, T3林场 → T4 兵营 → T5 active. Both barracks by T5. Good, symmetric with 朔原.\n\nSo turn 3: 朔原能源厂(120+15), 达川林场(57+5), 霜塘林场(57+5), 霜滩农场(69+5), 沃坝矿场(120+5) = 423金, 35木.\nWood at turn 3 start: 25 + 3(林场产出, 霜塘2+霜滩2... wait turn2 has 林场 from T1 active = 2 林场 producing 2木) → ~27. Not enough for 35.\n\nOK so I need to buy more wood or cut builds. Let me just buy wood each turn as needed — it's cheap (2.5/木).\n\nMoney check: 404 after turn 2. Turn 3 needs 423金. Not enough!\n\nSo I must economize. Let me drop