So T4: 350+40 = 390 > 350. Tight! Sell 矿 stock (10+2+2=14矿 → sell 12 = ~45金). OK feasible.\n\nThen T5: 兵营 active, recruit 1 army (10粮+5装, have 20粮5装) → 1 army.\nT6: buy 装备+粮 for more.\n\nThis works but leaves no room for 2nd barracks.\n\nAlternative: 达川 as 2nd barracks later once income improves.\n\nActually, let me reconsider the whole thing. Is 2 barracks even needed? 1 army/turn sustained. Over turns 5-15 = 11 armies. That's plenty to clear 16 wild tiles. Cost 11×60 = 660金 spread over turns. Income must support ~60金/turn + upkeep.\n\nIncome estimate with 5 tiles: 黄金矿场 10 + sell 粮(3×2=6) + 木(surplus) + 矿(4×2=8)... maybe 30-40金/turn. Plus army 补给 5金/军/回合 upkeep — 10 armies = 50金/turn! Ouch.\n\n补给: each army consumes 1 补给/turn, market 5金. 10 armies = 50金/turn. That's heavy. So I shouldn't over-expand army count; keep armies just enough, and consider 补给厂 later (粮1+矿1→补给2, cost 6金 → 10金 value, +4/turn, needs 1电).\n\nHmm, 补给厂 224金 回本56回合 but it also saves the market price pressure. Marginal.\n\nOK. Realistic approach: build up ~6-8 armies, clear the cheap wild tiles (P/D/F), then stop recruiting and consolidate economy. Total territory ~12.\n\nLet me just act turn by turn with good judgment, keeping treasury >200.\n\nTurn 2 concrete actions:\n1. Build: 朔原农场, 达川农场, 霜塘林场, 霜滩林场, 沃坝矿场 (354金, 25木)\n2. Sell 8 矿石 (stock 10→2) for ~32金\n3. Buy 15 木头 (~40金) to prep energy plant\n\nWait, buying wood at 2.5 while selling... fine.\n\nActually, I have 35木, spending 25 leaves 10. Turn 3 energy plant needs 15. Production +2. So need +3. Buying 15 now gives buffer for 兵营(20) later. Let me buy 20木.\n\nLet me check price impact: 木头 现价2.5, 持有35. Buying 20 → maybe 2.7-2.8 avg → ~55金.\n\nHmm, alternatively build fewer 林场 and buy less. Whatever, let's go.\n\nFinal turn 2:\n- build 5 (as above)\n- sell 矿石 8\n- buy 木头 20\n\nLet me execute builds in parallel first.",
