            "reasoning_content": "Turn 6. Treasury 90, 粮24, 装5, 木3, 矿2, 补给9. Army 1 at (19,7).\n\nActions:\n1. Recruit army #2 at 朔原 (10粮 5装) → free.\n2. Move army #2 to (19,7)? Fresh army — can it move same turn? Let's try.\n3. Sell surplus: 矿2, 木1 (keep 2 for... nothing). Actually keep wood for future. Sell 矿 2 (+6.6), 木 3 (+7.8).\n\nHmm, wood 3 is my whole stock. If I sell it, next building needs purchase. Wood price 2.6 is \"贵\" (high) — good time to sell. Let me sell 3木 (+7.8) and 2矿 (+6.6) = +14.\n\nTreasury → 104.\n\nThen T7: 2 armies attack (19,6)P.\n\nActually, wait. Let me reconsider the target choice. Options adjacent to my land:\n- (19,6)P: adjacent to 霜滩(19,7) ✓\n- (20,6)P: adjacent to 霜滩(19,7)? (20,6)-(19,7) diagonal = 1 tile ✓, and (20,7)M\n- (17,7)P: adjacent to 霜塘(18,8)? (17,7)-(18,8) diagonal ✓\n- (18,9)D: adjacent to 霜塘(18,8) ✓, 沃坝(19,9) ✓\n- (18,6)D: adjacent to 霜滩(19,7) diagonal ✓\n- (17,8)F: adjacent to 霜塘(18,8) ✓\n- (18,7)F: adjacent to 霜塘,霜滩 ✓\n\nDesert (18,9)D is nice: defense -10%, so my 2 armies deal 110 → kill in 1 round. And it's adjacent to two of my tiles.\n\nAlso (18,6)D desert.\n\nPriority: plains and desert first (1-round kills with 2 armies).\n\nTargets: (19,6)P, (20,6)P, (17,7)P, (18,9)D, (18,6)D — 5 easy tiles. Then forests (17,8)F, (18,7)F, (17,9)F, (21,7)F.\n\nNote: 楚 and 齐 haven't got armies yet. But they will soon (齐 has 2电, likely building barracks). My advantage window is short.\n\nLet me plan: T7 attack (19,6) with 2 armies. T8 attack... after taking (19,6), armies are there. Next targets from (19,6): (18,6)D, (20,6)P, (17,... no.\n\nActually better sequencing: \nT7: 2 armies from (19,7) attack (19,6)P → take it, armies at 75HP.\nT8: heal to 100 (if not in combat, +25/turn) → yes, after combat ends they're at peace. So T8 armies at 100HP. Meanwhile recruit army #3 (need 5装+10粮 = 42+0金).\nT8: attack (18,6)D and (20,6)P with 2 armies? Each attack needs 2 armies. So one attack per turn with 2 armies.\n\nHmm, that's 1 tile/turn. With 4 armies → 2 tiles/turn.\n\nLet me aim for 4 armies by T9, then 2 tiles/turn.\n\nCash: each army = 5装(42金) + 10粮(0 if self-produced, but production is 4/turn so mostly buy 6粮=12金) ≈ 54金. Plus 补给 upkeep 5金/army/turn.\n\nIncome: 4木+2矿+4粮 sold = 10.4+6.6+7.6 = 24.6金/turn gross, minus upkeep.\n\nWith 4 armies: upkeep 20金/turn → net income ~5金/turn. Barely.\n\nHmm, that's bad. I need the new tiles to produce.\n\nActually, wait. Let me reconsider 补给. 补给仓 9, my armies consume 1 each per turn. So 2 armies = 2/turn from stock. Stock 9 → 4.5 turns. Then must buy at 5金 each.\n\nAlternatively build 补给厂 (200金+12木 at plains, needs 1电 — I have 2电, 1 used by 兵营, so 1 free ✓). 补给厂: 粮1+矿1 → 补给2. My farms give 4粮, mines 2矿. So 补给厂 can run at 2补给/turn consuming 1粮1矿. Net: instead of buying 2补给 for 10金, I spend 1粮+1矿 (worth 6.6金). Saves 3.4金/turn. 回本 200/3.4 = 59回合. Not worth it.\n\nHmm. But it also saves market price pressure. Marginal.\n\nBetter: focus on grabbing 黄金 tiles. 黄金矿场 = +10金/回合, the only real income. 沃坝 has 黄金1 → 1 黄金矿场 (300金 in mountains). New tiles might have 黄金 too (unknown until captured).\n\nPriority: get 黄金矿场 at 沃坝 as soon as affordable (300金+10木).\n\nActually — hmm, is 黄金矿场 capped by 本地黄金? 沃坝 黄金1 → only 1. \n\nLet me reconsider: Should I stop military and go economy? The problem: without territory I can't get more 黄金 sites. With territory I get more slots for 黄金矿场/市政厅.\n\nI'll continue military but keep it lean (4 armies max), then pivot to economy + 黄金矿场.\n\nLet me now act T6:\n1. recruit #2 @朔原\n2. move #2 → (19,7)  [try]\n3. sell 矿2, 木3\n\nActually, hold the wood? I might want to build something. Next building I'd want: 达川 林场 (57金+5木) to reach 3 slots for a 2nd barracks... but 2nd barracks is 350金, unaffordable. So no building plans. Sell wood.\n\nHmm, but actually — 沃坝 黄金矿场 needs 10木. If I want it soon, I need wood. Wood production 4/turn. I can buy at 2.6. Fine, sell now, buy later.\n\nExecute.",
