            "reasoning_content": "Now in combat at (19,6). Turn end will resolve one round: my 2 armies deal 100 → 野人 dies (100HP). 野人 deals 50 split → 25 each. So both at 75HP and I take the tile.\n\nWait, but \"交战\" means they're in combat this turn. After resolution, if 野人 dies, they occupy the tile and combat ends.\n\nNow, should I do anything else this turn? Treasury 104.\n\nI want to recruit a 3rd army, but 装备 is 0 and price is 8.5 (贵 - high). Buying 5装备 = ~43金. That leaves 61.\n\nHmm. Let me think about the bigger economic picture again.\n\nCurrent income (if I sell all production): 粮4×1.9=7.6, 木4×2.4=9.6, 矿2×3.3=6.6 → ~24金/turn gross. Upkeep: 2 armies × 1补给 = 2/turn = 10金. Net ~14金/turn. Plus recruitment 54金/army.\n\nSo sustainably I can add ~1 army every 4 turns. Too slow for the expansion window.\n\nBetter idea: after taking (19,6), check its resources. If it has 黄金, build 黄金矿场 → +10金/回合.\n\nAlternatively, I should consider that my 5 (soon 6) tiles have limited resource caps: 朔原耕5(2 used), 达川耕2(2 used, at cap), 霜塘木3(2 used), 霜滩木2(2 used, at cap), 沃坝矿2(2 used, at cap)+黄金1(0 used).\n\nSo remaining buildable on current land: 朔原 农场×3 more (耕5, 2 used → 3 more), 霜塘 林场×1, 沃坝 黄金矿场×1.\n\n沃坝 黄金矿场 = 300金+10木 → +10金/回合. That's the single best income building available to me. I should prioritize saving for it.\n\nActually, hmm: 300金 for +10/turn = 30 turns to break even. But gold is the binding constraint, and it also doesn't depress any market.\n\nAlternatively 朔原 农场 (60金+5木) → +1粮/turn = 1.9金/turn. 回本 32回合. Worse.\n\nSo: 黄金矿场 at 沃坝 is priority #1 for economy. Need 300金 + 10木.\n\nLet me plan: T7 attack (done). T8: 野人 dead, tile taken, armies at 75HP → heal to 100 by T9.\nT8: with 2 armies at (19,6), attack (18,6)D or (20,6)P next turn.\n\nActually (19,6) is adjacent to (18,6)D, (20,6)P, (19,... ) and (18,7)F, (20,7)M.\n\nLet me continue: T8 attack (20,6)P (adjacent to (19,6) ✓). T9 attack (18,6)D. T10 attack (17,7)P? From (18,6) → (17,7) diagonal ✓.\n\nEach attack: 2