1.9+3.3 = 5.2金. Net +4.8金/turn.\n- 回本: 200/4.8 = 42回合. Plus it avoids buying 补给 at 5金.\n\nHmm. Still weak. But if I have 4 armies needing 4补给/turn, the 补给厂 covers half, saving 10金/turn vs market.\n\nActually the real question: is it better to sell 粮+矿 (5.2金) or convert to 补给 (10金)? Converting nets +4.8. So yes, 补给厂 is strictly better than selling raw, but 200金 upfront.\n\nGiven my cash crisis, defer.\n\nPRIORITY: 黄金矿场 (300金) > 补给厂 (200金) > more farms.\n\nHmm, actually, let me reconsider. What generates the most gold? Capturing tiles that have 黄金. Let me capture (19,6) and check its resources next turn.\n\nOK for T7 remaining actions:\n- Buy 装备 5 (43金)? That enables army #3 at T8.\n- Or save for 黄金矿场.\n\nI think a 3rd army is valuable: with 3 armies I can do 1 pair + 1 (no, single army can't take tiles). Actually 3 armies: attack with 3 → 150 damage, 野人 deals 50/3 = 16.7 each. Still 1 tile/turn but less damage taken (17 vs 25). That extends operational endurance: 100HP / 17 = 5 attacks before rest. Better tempo!\n\nActually with 3 armies: 150 dmg kills a 100HP 野人 with overkill; damage taken 50/3≈17 per army per attack. So 5 attacks in a row (17×5 = 85 < 100). That's 5 tiles in 5 turns! Much better tempo than 3 tiles in 4 turns.\n\nWith 4 armies: 200 dmg, take 12.5/attack → 8 attacks. Or split into 2 pairs → 2 tiles/turn, take 25 each.\n\nHmm, 4 armies as 1 group of 4 = 1 tile/turn but 8 consecutive turns. As 2 pairs = 2 tiles/turn, 4 consecutive turns.\n\n2 tiles/turn is better tempo. Let's aim for 4 armies.\n\nCost: 2 more armies = 2×(5装 + 10粮) = 10装(85金) + 20粮. Treasury 104 → need to also buy food eventually.\n\nRealistic: T7 buy 5装 (43) → 61金. T8 recruit #3. T9 sell output (+24) → 85金, buy 5装 (44) → 41金. T10 recruit #4...\n\nThis is slow and leaves zero buffer. Meanwhile income grows as I take tiles.\n\nAlternative: accept 1 tile per 2 turns with 2 armies, and use saved cash for 黄金矿场.\n\nLet me estimate: 2 armies, pattern attack/rest/attack/rest... Actually as computed, attack T8 (75→50), attack T9 (50→25), T10 rest (25→50), T11 rest (50→75)... Hmm, better: attack, attack, rest, rest cycle = 2 tiles/4 turns = 0.5/turn. Or attack, rest, attack = 2 tiles/3 turns = 0.67/turn.\n\nWith 3 armies: attack×5, rest×1 → 5 tiles/6 turns = 0.83/turn.\nWith 4 armies as 2 pairs: 2 tiles/turn for 4 turns, then rest 2 turns → 8 tiles/6 turns = 1.33/turn. But only 16 wild tiles exist and 楚/齐 will grab some.\n\nHonestly, my cash limits me to ~2-3 armies. Let me plan for 3 armies and 1 tile/turn tempo, prioritizing plains/desert/forest (skip hills/mountain).\n\nLet me buy 装备 now? Price 8.5 = 贵. Selling/buying at high price is bad. Maybe wait for regression. But I need it.\n\nAlternative: don't buy now; T8 recruit army #3 requires 装备 which I don't have. So must buy.\n\nDecision: buy 5 装备 now (43金, ~61 left). Recruit at T8.\n\nHmm, actually wait. Let me reconsider: should I instead spend on 黄金矿场 to fix income? I only have 104金, can't afford 300.\n\nWhat about selling stuff I have? 粮18 → sell 8粮 = 15金 (but need food for recruiting). 木3, 矿2 → 14金.\n\nLet me sell 矿2 + 木3 now (+14) → treasury 118-43 = 75. And keep food.\n\nActually, I realize I should double check: is 装备 needed at 5 per 步兵? Yes: 步=步兵(10粮+5装).\n\nOK T7 remaining actions:\n1. sell 木头 3, 矿石 2 (+14)\n2. buy 装备 5 (-43)\n\nNet: 104+14-43 = 75.\n\nLet me do it.\n\nHmm, one concern: 木头 2.4 is \"贵\" — good to sell. 矿石 3.3 \"贱\" — bad to sell (baseline 4). But I have no use for ore. Sell it anyway? Selling 2 ore at 3.3 → 6.6金. It's a trickle. Actually if I later build 补给厂 I need 矿 as input, produced locally. So don't sell the stock... but stock 2 is nothing. Sell.\n\nLet me sell 木3 and buy 装备5. Keep 矿2 as buffer.\n\nActually, let me keep 3 wood too — I'll need wood for buildings (黄金矿场 10木). Wood production 4/turn. Selling 3 now at 2.4 then buying 10 later at 2.4 = wash. Cash now matters more? No, I'm buying equipment anyway.\n\nFine: sell 木3 (+7), buy 装备5 (-43) → 68金.\n\nLet me just do that.",
