            "reasoning_content": "Turn 9. 新丘(19,6) captured! It has 耕地3, no 黄金/木/矿/油. Hmm, 3 farms possible → 3粮/turn = 5.4金/turn. Modest.\n\nCurrent: 国库55, 粮16, 木3, 矿2, 装0, 补给8. 3 armies: #1(70), #2(71) at (19,6); #3(100) at (19,7).\n\nGrid: 产2/需1 (兵营用1电). 1 spare 电.\n\nWild tiles now 18 (new ones appeared: (18,5)F, (19,5)M, (20,5)P — expansion of the frontier as my territory grows).\n\nTargets adjacent to my armies:\n- From (19,6): (20,6)P, (18,6)D, (19,5)M, (18,5)F, (20,5)P, (18,7)F\n- From (19,7): (20,6)P, (18,6)D, (18,7)F, (20,7)M, (17,7)P? (19,7)→(17,7) is distance 2. No.\n\nPlan T9: attack (20,6)P with armies 1,2,3? #3 at (19,7) is adjacent to (20,6) ✓ (diagonal). So all 3 armies can attack (20,6).\n\n3 armies → 150 damage, kills 100HP 野人 in 1 round. Damage taken: 50/3 ≈ 17 each. #1: 70-17=53, #2: 71-17=54, #3: 100-17=83.\n\nThen T10: attack (18,6)D from (20,6)? (20,6)→(18,6) distance 2. No. Hmm.\nFrom (20,6), adjacent: (20,5)P, (21,5), (21,6), (19,5)M, (20,7)M, (19,6)✓, (21,7)F.\nSo after taking (20,6), next targets: (20,5)P, (21,7)F, (20,7)M, (21,6)...\n\nAlternatively take (18,6)D first from (19,6)/(19,7), then (18,5)F, (17,7)P, (17,8)F...\n\nLet me think about which direction to push. My core is (18-20, 6-10). \n- North: (19,5)M, (20,5)P, (18,5)F\n- East: (20,6)P, (21,7)F, (20,7)M, (21,8)M, (20,9)H, (21,9)H, (20,10)H\n- West: (17,7)P, (17,8)F, (17,9)F, (18,6)D\n- South: (18,9)D, (18,10)H, (19,10)H\n\nEasy (P/D): (20,6)P, (20,5)P, (17,7)P, (18,6)D, (18,9)D\nMedium (F): (18,7)F, (17,8)F, (17,9)F, (18,5)F, (21,7)F\nHard (H/M): (18,10)H, (19,10)H, (20,9)H, (20,10)H, (21,9)H, (19,5)M, (20,7)M, (21,8)M\n\nWith 3 armies (150 dmg):\n- P/D: kill 100 in 1 round, take 17 each ✓\n- F: 野人 has +10% def → my dmg 150×0.9 = 135 > 100 ✓ 1 round, take 17 each\n- H: 150×0.75 = 112 > 100 ✓ 1 round! take 17 each\n- M: 150×0.5 = 75 < 100 → 2 rounds, take 34 total\n\nSo 3 armies can clear P/D/F/H in one round each. Excellent! Only 山地 needs 2 rounds.\n\nSo the constraint is movement/repositioning, and HP endurance.\n\nGreat, let's push. Sequence:\nT9: 3 armies attack (20,6)P. #1,#2 from (19,6), #3 from (19,7).\nT10: from (20,6) attack (20,5)P? or (21,7)F. Hmm, but I also want (18,6)D, (17,7)P, (18,9)D which are west/south.\n\nActually, better: T9 attack (18,6)D (from (19,6) ✓ and (19,7) ✓ diagonal? (19,7)→(18,6) diagonal ✓). Then T10 from (18,6): (17,7)P ✓, (18,5)F ✓, (18,7)F ✓, (17,6), (19,5)M.\n\nWest chain: (18,6)D → (17,7)P → (17,8)F → (17,9)F → (18,9)D → (18,10)H... that's a nice contiguous run of 6 tiles!\n\nEast chain: (20,6)P → (21,7)F → (20,7)M → (21,8)M → (20,9)H → (21,9)H\n\nSouth chain: (18,9)D, (19,10)H, (18,10)H, (20,10)H\n\nNorth: (18,5)F, (19,5)M, (20,5)P\n\nTotal 18 tiles. I can't take all. Let me prioritize west+south chain (contiguous, mostly easy) and east.\n\nHmm, actually a critical consideration: HP. 3 armies at ~70/70/100. Each attack costs ~17. After 4 attacks: 53,54,83 → then need rest. Rest = +25/turn.\n\nAlso 补给: 8 in仓, 3 armies consume 3/turn → 2.6 turns. Need to buy more. 补给 price 5.3 = 贵. Ugh. Buying 6 more = 34金.\n\nCash: 55金. I need to sell production. 粮16 (price 1.8 贱 — bad time to sell, but I need cash). 木3 (2.2 贵 — good to sell). 矿2 (3.0 贱).\n\nHmm. Let me think: I have 16粮. Army #4 would need 10粮+5装(8.7=44金). Equipment is expensive. Maybe skip army #4.\n\nPriorities with 55金:\n(a) Buy 补给 (~34金 for 6) — necessary to keep armies supplied.\n(b) Build on 新丘 (耕地3): 农场 60金+5木 each. Affordable? 60金 → leaves nothing.\n(c) 黄金矿场 at 沃坝: 300金. Not now.\n\nLet me sell 木3 + 矿2 = 6.6+6 = 12.6金 → 68金. Then buy 补给 6 (-34) → 34金.\n\nHmm, tight. Alternatively buy 补给 4 (-21) → 47金.\n\nActually, let me reconsider: 补给仓 8, 3 armies = 3/turn. So 8 lasts to T11. I can delay purchase. But armies in combat... they consume 补给 each turn regardless.\n\nLet me buy 补给 5 (~27金) and sell 木3+矿2 (+12). Treasury 55-27+12 = 40.\n\nHmm, 40 is low. But I'll get +22金/turn from selling production... except I need 粮 for nothing now (no recruitmen