s 补给 upkeep.\n\nThat's actually decent — ~50金/turn if fully built out. But building it out costs: 12 farms (720金) + 3 more 林场 (170) + 黄金矿场 (300) ≈ 1200金. I have 55.\n\nSo the real game is: build up economy over many turns, funded by gradual sales. Military expansion adds slots.\n\nGiven cash at 55, immediate priority = income. The cheapest income boost: 农场 at 新丘 (60金). Hmm, can't afford with 55.\n\nOK so T9: sell stuff to raise cash, buy 补给 minimally, attack with 3 armies.\n\nLet me maximize cash: sell 木3 (2.2 贵 → +6.6), 矿2 (3.0 → +6), 粮8 (1.8 → +14) = +26.6 → 82金. Then buy 补给 6 (~33) → 49金. Then build 农场 at 新丘 (60金+5木)? Need 5木, have 0. Buy 5木 (~12) → total 72金. Can't.\n\nAlternative: don't sell wood/ore; build 农场 at 新丘 needs 60金+5木. Have 55金+3木. Sell 粮 5 (+9) → 64金, buy 3木 (+7) → 70金... then 农场 60金 → 10金 left. Too risky.\n\nLet me just attack + sell + buy 补给, and defer building.\n\nActually, hmm — what about attacking (18,6)D vs (20,6)P? Both fine. Let me pick (18,6)D — desert, and it opens the west chain (17,7)P, (18,5)F, (18,7)F, (17,6).\n\nWait, actually let me reconsider: which chain leads to more easy tiles? \n- (18,6) → then (17,7)P, (18,5)F, (18,7)F, (17,6)?, (19,5)M\n- (20,6) → then (20,5)P, (21,7)F, (21,6)?, (19,5)M\n\nBoth similar. But note new tiles appear as I expand (the 可拓荒地 list grows). So more captures = more options.\n\nI'll go (18,6)D west.\n\nActually, one important thought: 18,6 is adjacent to 霜滩(19,7) and 新丘(19,6). And after taking it, (17,7)P and (17,8)F and (18,7)F become reachable, then (17,9)F, (18,9)D, (18,10)H... a long chain of 6-7 tiles on the west side. Good.\n\nLet's do it: attack (18,6) with armies 1,2,3.\n\nThen sell 木3, 矿2, 粮6.\nThen buy 补给 6.\n\nCash: 55 + 6.6 + 6 + 10.8 = 78 → -33 = 45.\n\nHmm, food: 16-6 = 10粮. Fine.\n\nLet me execute.",
