            "reasoning_content": "Now revise the 国策 (mandatory this turn).\n\nLet me write an updated plan reflecting reality:\n- 7 tiles, 3 armies, ~10 tiles captured plan\n- Cash crisis: 51金\n- Income ~25金/turn gross, 补给 upkeep 16金/turn (3 armies)\n- Priorities: keep 1 tile/turn tempo with 3 armies while healthy; then rest; build 黄金矿场(沃坝 300金+10木) → +10金/回合; 补给厂 (200金+12木, saves 8金/turn) once affordable; consider 4th army only if cash allows.\n- 新丘 耕地3 → farms later.\n- Diplomacy: neutral, no letters. Intel: spies done T1 (data from T4), refresh spy on 楚 around T12-14 (楚 had 805金 — likely has barracks/army by now).\n\nLet me write it.",
