isband, so I'll just under-feed and the weakest dies). Hmm, but that wastes 60金.\n\nAlternative: keep 3 armies but use them to grab 1-2 more high-value tiles (e.g., ones likely to have 黄金). Hmm, it's a lottery.\n\nHmm, let me reconsider. Actually, let me look at this from a completely different angle: what if the smart play is to STOP being a price-taker and instead build the 黄金矿场 as fast as possible by liquidating everything?\n\nLiquidation: 8粮 (9.6) + 7木 (12.6) + 8矿 (22.4) = 44.6金 → treasury 106.\nThen 补给厂 needs 200. \n\nOr: 黄金矿场 needs 300.\n\nNeither reachable now.\n\nOK, let me think about the most efficient path:\nStep 1: Build 补给厂 (200金+12木) → cuts 补给 purchases from 17 to ~6金/turn (I'd buy 1/turn). Net income becomes ~11.6金/turn (at current prices) or ~18 (at baseline).\nStep 2: 黄金矿场 (300金+10木) → +10金/turn.\nStep 3: Develop mines/farms.\n\nTo get step 1, I need +138金. At +0.6/turn that's impossible. So I must cut army upkeep in the interim.\n\nPractical: buy 补给 at only 2/turn (under-feed by 1). The 3rd army loses 10HP/turn. It's at 100 → dies in 10 turns. During those 10 turns I save 5.7/turn = 57金. Then I'm at 2 armies with 11.4金/turn upkeep → net +6.2/turn.\n\nAlternatively under-feed by 2 (buy 1/turn): two armies decay, one gets fed. Hmm, the warehouse feeds... unclear which army.\n\nHonestly, the cleanest: **stop buying 补给 entirely for ~4-5 turns, letting all 3 armies drop to ~50-60HP, saving 85金**, then resume buying and they heal. That's a temporary buffer, not permanent. It gets me to ~147金... then sell stock 44 → 191金. Then buy 补给厂 at T19!\n\nWait, but during those 5 turns I also have income from selling production (17.6/turn = 88金). Let me redo:\n\nT15-T19 (5 turns): \n- Income: sell 木4+矿2+粮4 per turn = 17.6金/turn × 5 = 88金\n- Outflow: 0 (no 补给 purchases)\n- Armies: 100 → 50HP each (5 turns × -10)\n- Treasury: 62 + 88 + stock liquidation... = 150\n- T19: buy 补给厂 materials. Need 12木: I'd have 7 + 20 production - 20 sold = 7. Let me not sell wood; keep 