            "tool_call_id": "call_2d2b5aa94b6e42aba87c702b",
            "content": "【经济核算 · 当前市价】单位建筑投入产出（木头按现价折金入造价，市政厅=5金基础+本地建筑×1金/回合）：\n现价: 粮食=2.0  木头=2.0  矿石=4.0  石油=6.0  装备=8.0  补给=5.0\n  城堡: L1造价 100金+10木(折120金) · 每级+10%防御，不产金\n  林场: 造价折60金 · 每回合产出折金≈2金 · 回本≈30回合\n  农场: 造价折70金 · 每回合产出折金≈2金 · 回本≈35回合\n  矿场: 造价折90金 · 每回合产出折金≈4金 · 回本≈22回合\n  石油厂: 造价折166金 · 每回合产出折金≈6金 · 回本≈28回合\n  黄金矿场: 造价折220金 · 每回合产出固定+金≈10金 · 回本≈22回合\n  木材能源厂: 造价折150金 · 每回合烧燃料现值≈2金 → 产2电（电不交易，供高级建筑维持）\n  石油能源厂: 造价折330金 · 每回合烧燃料现值≈6金 → 产5电（电不交易，供高级建筑维持）\n  补给厂: 造价折224金 · 每回合投6金现价料→产10金现价货（毛利+4金；另耗1电≈1金） · 回本≈56回合\n  装备厂: 造价折264金 · 每回合投10金现价料→产16金现价货（毛利+6金；另耗1电≈1金） · 回本≈44回合\n  兵营: 造价折390金 · 不自动产金，每兵营每回合可征1军（步10粮5装 / 骑12粮12装，耗兵料另计）\n  市政厅: 造价折580金 · 每回合 = 5金基础 + 该地块每座建筑×1金（不含自身；10建筑城≈15金/回合） · 需本地已用位≥6、每地块限1座、耗1电"
          },
          {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "【刷新】你楚 国库1500 粮20 木60 矿10 油0 装5 补给仓10 | 军队0 | 收信0 | 关系:秦=中立  齐=中立 | 近讯见 events。继续你的行动，做完了调 end_turn。"
          },
          {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "",
            "reasoning_content": "Let me plan turn 1. I have 1500 gold, 60 wood, 20 food, 10 ore, 5 equipment, 0 oil. 5 tiles, all plains except 云谷 (hills). Resources:\n\n- 苍堰 (27,24) 平原: 矿0 金0 耕2 油0 木1\n- 宣邑 (28,23) 平原: 矿1 金0 耕2 油0 木1\n- 云谷 (28,24) 丘陵: 矿0 金0 耕3 油0 木2 (丘陵: 建设惩罚+25%, 防御+25%)\n- 岚栅 (28,25) 平原: 矿0 金0 耕1 油0 木2\n- 碧庭 (29,24) 平原: 矿0 金0 耕5 油0 木2\n\nTotal: 耕地 13, 木头 8, 矿石 1.\n\nKey: no gold income except 黄金矿场 (none available in my tiles — 黄金x0 everywhere). So my income is from production + market sales. 国库 1500 is my only capital. I need to be efficient.\n\nStrategy considerations: Early game, the highest-value thing is probably food/wood production plus military expansion to grab wasteland tiles (all 16 have 野人 with 100HP). To take land I need an army: 兵营 requires 3 building slots used on that tile, plus 1 electricity (needs 能源厂), plus recruiting costs 10粮+5装.\n\nAlso 装备: I have 5 装备, enough for 1 infantry if I had a 兵营. Equipment is needed for recruiting; 装备厂 needs 矿+油 which I lack (my tiles have 矿1, 油0). So I'll need to buy oil/ore or equipment from market.\n\nTimeline: buildings built this turn become active next turn (在建). 兵营 needs 3 buildings used on the tile. So fastest path to a barracks:\n- Turn 1: build 3 buildings on one tile (each tile limited to 1 building per turn!). Hmm — \"每地块每回合限建1座\". So one tile can only get 1 building per turn. To get 3 buildings on a tile takes 3 turns (buildings land next turn... does 在建 count toward used slots? \"需本地已用建筑位≥3（含在建）\" — yes, includes under construction). So turn1 build A, turn2 build B, turn3 build C → at turn3, used slots = 3 (2 under construction + 1 being built). Then barracks needs 4th turn? Actually barracks itself is a building; requirement is 已用建筑位≥3 which includes 在建, so on turn 4 I could build the barracks if slots ≥3 already. Wait on turn 3 I have 2 built (from turn1, turn2) + 1 在建 → 3 used. So turn 3 could build barracks instead of a third resource building. Let's think.\n\nAlternatively spread: build on multiple tiles in parallel (1 per tile per turn). Since each tile allows 1 build per turn, I can build 5 buildings in one turn across 5 tiles. But barracks needs 3 on the SAME tile.\n\nOptimal: pick 碧庭 (29,24) which has 耕地5 + 木2 — best tile. Build there each turn.\n\nTurn 1: 碧庭 农场 (or 林场?). 碧庭 has 木2, 耕5.\n\nLet me think about the overall economy. Wood is needed for all construction; I have 60 wood. 林场 costs 50金+5木, produces 1 wood/turn. Wood value 2. 农场 60金+5木 → 1 food/turn (2 gold). 矿场 80金+5木 → 1 ore (4 gold) but limited by 矿 resources: only 宣邑 has 矿1. So only 1 mine possible on my starting tiles.\n\nGold income sources: no gold mines in my territory (all 黄金x0). So my long-run income = value of production + processing margins (补给厂 +4/turn, 装备厂 +6/turn) + 市政厅.\n\nActually, wait — expansion tiles may have gold resources. The wasteland tiles show only terrain and 野人 status; resources unknown until captured? The land panel shows resources for my tiles. For wasteland, it lists (26,23)P[野人] without resources. So capturing may reveal resources. Some may have 黄金.\n\nImportant: 黄金矿场 = +10 gold/turn for 200金+10木 → 22 turn payback, and it's the only real gold income. Capturing tiles with gold deposits is high value.\n\nMilitary: primitives have 100HP each, defend with terrain bonus. My army 100HP, base damage 50 per army per turn roll. Attacking: \"攻方在敌地无加成\". Damage: each army base 50, modified by defender's terrain+castle%... Actually \"每军基础伤害 50，受守方地形+城堡防御%修正…总伤害分摊\". So if I attack with 1 army vs 1 primitive on plain (0% def): total damage 100 (50+50) split among enemies = 50 to the primitive → primitive deals 50 to me. Round 2: primitive at 50HP deals 50, I deal 50 → primitive dies at 0, I'm at ~50HP. That's a pyrrhic single attack. Better to attack with 2 armies: total damage 100 split among 1 enemy = 100 → primitive dies in one round, I take 50 split between 2 = 25 each. Hmm, \"总伤害分摊\" means damage is split among the enemies in the battle. With 2 attackers vs 1 defender, defender's 50 damage splits between 2 → 25 each. So 2 armies per attack kills a primitive in one round with 25 damage each.\n\nBut note: attacking a tile — 野人 on that tile defends. If I send 2 armies to one tile, both fight. So each capture costs ~50 HP total damage which heals at +25/turn when not engaged and supplied. Supply: each army consumes 1 补给/turn. I have 10 补给.\n\nAlso: multiple 野人 can be fought simultaneously? Each army must be in a battle. With 2 armies per tile, and healing 25/turn, an army can attack roughly every 2 turns if taking 25 damage... Actually if 2 armies attack 1 primitive: each takes 25. Next turn heal +25 if not engaged. So alternate.\n\nFaster: use 3-4 armies per attack to reduce damage. But recruiting is 1 army per barracks per turn, costing 10粮+5装.\n\nEquipment: I have 5. Need 5 per infantry. So I can recruit 1 immediately once barracks exists. Then I need more equipment — buy from market (8 gold each) or build 装备厂 (needs 矿+油; I have 矿1 on 宣邑, 油0). Buying equipment: 10 food + 5 equipment = 20 + 40 = 60 gold worth of materials per infantry, plus supply costs. That's affordable with 1500 gold.\n\nActually, food: recruiting costs 10粮. I have 20粮. Buying food is cheap (2/each). So army upkeep in gold terms: infantry ≈ 10*2 + 5*8 = 60 gold one-time + 1 supply/turn (5 gold) — hmm supply can be produced (补给厂: 粮1+矿1→补给2, margin +4).\n\nPlan priority for turn 1:\n1. Build production on all 5 tiles (1 each). Which buildings?\n   - 碧庭 (耕5木2): 农场 (food for recruiting) — or 林场? Wood needed for construction; I have 60 wood which is plenty for early. Food needed for recruiting (10/army) and 补给厂. Let's do 农场.\n   - 云谷 (耕3木2, 丘陵 +25% build cost): 农场 or 林场.\n   - 苍堰 (耕2木1): 林场 or 农场.\n   - 宣邑 (矿1耕2木1): 矿场 (only mine possible, 4 gold/turn, payback 22 turns).\n   - 岚栅 (耕1木2): 林场.\n\nBut wait — for the barracks I need 3 buildings on ONE tile. Concentrating on 碧庭 gives fastest barracks but leaves other 4 tiles idle this turn. Alternatively: build 1 on each of 5 tiles now, then on 碧庭 continue each turn: turn2 碧庭 gets 2nd building, turn3 3rd (or barracks at turn3 since 在建 counts). Let's compute: Turn1: 碧庭 农场 (starts 在建, lands turn 2 settlement). Turn2: 碧庭 林场 (used slots at build time = 1 from 农场 now built). Turn3: 碧庭 农场#2 → after this, used = 3. Turn4: 碧庭 兵营 (requires ≥3 at time of building — yes 3 used). Barracks built during turn 4, active turn 5. First recruit turn 5.\n\nHmm, but barracks also needs electricity: 能源厂 (木材能源厂 120金+15木, burns 1 wood → 2电). Barracks needs 1电 maintenance. Also 补给厂/装备厂/市政厅 need power. So I need a 木材能源厂 on some tile too (any tile). Note: 电 is national grid.\n\nLet me instead plan: 碧庭 as military/industry hub.\n\nTurn 1 builds (5 tiles, 1 each = 5 buildings, cost check):\n- 碧庭: 农场 (60金+5木)\n- 宣邑: 矿场 (80金+5木)\n- 岚栅: 林场 (50金+5木)\n- 苍堰: 林场 (50金+5木)\n- 云谷: 木材能源厂? 丘陵 +25% gold cost → 120*1.25=150金 + 15木. Energy plant gives 2电 (burns 1 wood → 2电). Actually 能源厂 can be built on any tile. Better on plain to avoid penalty. Hmm, but each tile 1 build/turn. Let me put 能源厂 on 苍堰 (plain) and 林场 on 云谷? 云谷 is hills: 林场 50*1.25 = 62.5→63金 +5木. Wood 2 on 云谷, 耕地3.\n\nActually let's reconsider: the 电网 needs to cover 兵营(1电) + 补给厂(1) + 装备厂(1) + 市政厅(1). 木材能源厂 gives 2电 each. So 2 木材能源厂 = 4电.\n\nPriority: get an army ASAP to expand, since expansion tiles may hold gold deposits. Total gold 1500 is a big war chest; spending it on buildings is fine but I should keep a reserve for buying equipment/food/oil and diplomatic costs.\n\nTurn 1 concrete plan:\n- 碧庭 (29,24): 农场 — food base for the military hub.\n- 宣邑 (28,23): 矿场 (only 矿 tile) — ore for 装备厂/补给厂.\n- 岚栅 (28,25): 林场.\n- 苍堰 (27,24): 木材能源厂 (120金+15木) → 2电. Hmm, do I need power yet? Barracks comes turn 4. Power plant can come turn 2-3. Building it turn1 wastes a turn of no output but it burns wood for 2电 only when needed? Actually 能源厂 produces electricity always (consuming 1 wood/turn) — if nothing needs power, it's just burning wood? Probably yes, wasted. Better to build 能源厂 in the turn before barracks completes. Let's build 林场 on 苍堰 now, and 能源厂 later.\n- 云谷 (28,24): 农场 (hills penalty, but food needed). Or 林场.\n\nLet me think about wood budget: 60 wood. Each building costs 5-20 wood. Turn1 5 buildings ≈ 25-30 wood. Fine.\n\nWood income: 林场 1/turn each. 能源厂 burns 1 wood/turn for 2电. So need enough 林场.\n\nLet me decide turn 1 builds:\n1. 碧庭 农场\n2. 宣邑 矿场\n3. 岚栅 林场\n4. 苍堰 林场\n5. 云谷 农场\n\nCost: 60+80+50+50+63(丘陵) = 303金; wood: 5*5=25木. Remaining: ~1197金, 35木.\n\nHmm, that's a lot of gold spent. But buildings are the engine. Actually maybe skip 云谷 农场 (hills penalty) and instead save. Or build 云谷 林场 (5木 vs 农场 63金). 云谷 has 木2 耕3.\n\nAlso consider: should I buy stuff? Oil is 0 and needed for 装备厂. Ore is limited. Alternatively just buy equipment from market as needed for recruiting (8 gold each, 5 per army = 40). Buying will push price up. Selling wood? I have 60 wood; selling pushes price down but I need wood for construction.\n\nAlso should I consider 间谍 on 秦/齐? 100 gold each. Knowing neighbors' economies and maps is valuable. With 1500 gold, spying on both = 200 gold. It reveals their armies count and their known map (which includes their land and adjacent ring — could show more wasteland tiles with resources? Actually intel gives their known map). Early info is cheap and useful. I think spying on both is reasonable but maybe just one now (秦? unknown position). Let me check countries panel for positions/distance. Actually countries panel shows relations/borders. Let me query countries and land for more detail (wasteland resources hidden).\n\nLet me also consider diplomacy: propose 共同防御 with one of them to be safe? Cost 10 gold, and if they accept I get security but they drag me into wars. Early game with primitives, maybe not needed. But info: 秦 and 齐 could expand faster. Hmm. Actually a key risk: another country attacking me early. My army starts 0. A 共同防御 pact is defensive only, and both must be at peace. It's cheap (10 gold). But they may refuse.\n\nI think turn 1: build + spy on both (200 gold) + maybe send a letter proposing friendship? Letters cost 20. Let me not spam letters.\n\nLet me first query countries to see who borders me.\n\nActually, my visible map is only my 5 tiles + adjacent ring, and all 16 adjacent tiles are wasteland with primitives — meaning I don't border anyone yet. Good.\n\nLet me do: query countries + intel? Let me just do countries.\n\nThen build 5, then spy 秦 and 齐, then plan, then end_turn.\n\nWait — can I spy on a country I don't border? Yes, spy target just can't be self. Cost 100 each, 3 turns delay.\n\nHmm, is spying worth it early? Their economies at turn 1 are similar to mine (1500 gold, 5 tiles). Info value is low right now but the map they reveal could show resource-rich wastelands. Actually the spy report includes \"它的整张已知地图\" — which shows tiles they can see, including resource info? Probably shows terrain/owner. My own land panel shows resources for owned tiles; for wasteland it shows only terrain+garrison. So map intel may not reveal resources of wasteland either.\n\nBetter: expand and see for myself. So maybe spy on just one (or none) now, and save gold. I'll spy on 秦 (name suggests a big rival) — or maybe do both later when more relevant. Let me do one spy now to learn their build pattern and army counts, cost 100.\n\nActually, let me think about what matters most: my army timeline. Barracks active turn 5, first infantry turn 5, first capture turn 5-6. That's slow. Can I speed up? The bottleneck is 兵营 requiring 3 buildings on one tile.\n\nAlternative: build only on 碧庭 each turn: T1 农场, T2 林场, T3 农场#2 (used=3 after this build), T4 兵营+能源厂 elsewhere... wait T4 needs 兵营 on 碧庭 (4th slot) and 木材能源厂 on another tile (any tile, 1 per tile per turn — so I can build both in T4 since different tiles). 兵营 lands T5 settlement, so recruit possible T5. Same as before basically. The constraint is 1 build per tile per turn, so concentrating on one tile is slower in terms of slot accumulation.\n\nHmm what about: T1 碧庭农场, T2 碧庭林场, T3 碧庭矿场? 碧庭 has 矿0 → can't build mine (上限=本地资源). 碧庭 resources: 耕5 木2 → 5 farms + 2 lumber = 7 possible buildings. So T1 farm, T2 lumber, T3 farm → used 3 → T4 barracks + power plant (on another tile) → T5 recruit.\n\nMeanwhile other tiles idle for 3 turns = lost income. Balanced approach: T1 build on all 5 tiles (as I planned), then continue on 碧庭 each turn: T2 碧庭 #2, T3 碧庭 #3 → at T3 碧庭 used = 3 (farm from T1 built + T2 building + T3 building). Then T4 兵营 on 碧庭 + 能源厂 on another tile (e.g., 苍堰 or 岚栅). Recruit T5. First attack T5.\n\nAlternatively at T3 build 兵营 on 碧庭 (requires used≥3 at build time: at T3 before building, used = 2 (T1 farm + T2 building). Not enough. So T4 earliest. OK.\n\nSo: army #1 at turn 5, and 1 per turn thereafter (need equipment: 5/army; I have 5 → 1 free; then buy).\n\nTo get more armies per turn, build multiple barracks (each 1 army/turn) on multiple tiles once those tiles have 3 buildings. Later.\n\nAlso 市政厅 needs 6 buildings on a tile — 碧庭 can reach that (7 possible). Nice for gold income later: 5 + 6 = 11 gold/turn for 500金+40木. Payback ~45 turns. Meh. Gold mines on captured tiles are better.\n\nGiven no gold income at all in starting territory, and 1500 gold capital, I must be careful: buildings that don't produce gold drain me. Income sources: sell production surplus. Farms produce food (2 gold each at market). 矿场 4 gold. 补给厂 +4 margin. 装备厂 +6 margin.\n\nActually the real strategy: gold is a finite pool unless I find gold mines or run a trade surplus. Since I can sell goods to the world market, production = gold. Farms at 2 gold/turn each with 35-turn payback — that's a 5.7% return per turn... fine.\n\nBetter ROI: 矿场 (90折, 4/turn, 22 turns), 黄金矿场 (220, 10/turn). And expansion is the main lever: more tiles = more resources incl. gold deposits.\n\nSo military-first is right: rush the barracks, then take wasteland tiles aggressively, prioritizing tiles with gold.\n\nLet me also secure food supply: farms. 碧庭耕5, 云谷耕3, 苍堰2, 宣邑2, 岚栅1 = 13 farms max → 13 food/turn. Recruiting needs 10 food/army; supply plant needs 1 food + 1 ore → 2 supply. Ore is scarce (1 mine in starting land). Buy ore from market as needed (4 gold).\n\nOK. Turn 1 actions:\n1. Build 5 buildings (one per tile): 碧庭农场, 宣邑矿场, 岚栅林场, 苍堰林场, 云谷农场.\n2. spy 秦 (100金) — maybe.\n3. plan (国策).\n4. end_turn.\n\nWait, should I also buy equipment now to prepare? Price 8 baseline; buying 20 pushes price up. I'll buy when needed (turn 4). Fine.\n\nAlso should I consider selling wood? I have 60 wood, spending ~25 this turn. Wood is needed for buildings and as fuel for 木材能源厂. Keep.\n\nLet me double check build costs and my resources: 农场 60金+5木, 矿场 80金+5木, 林场 50金+5木 (plain), 云谷 农场 = 60*1.25 = 75金 + 5木. Total gold = 60+80+50+50+75 = 315; wood = 25. After: 1185金, 35木.\n\nHmm, 云谷 hills — maybe build 林场 there instead (50*1.25=62.5→63金). Marginal. 云谷 has 耕3木2. Farms on hills cost 75 vs lumber 63. Food is more needed than wood long-term (13 vs 8 wood potential). Actually I have plenty of wood (60) and need food for recruiting. Keep 农场 on 云谷.\n\nLet me also think: is 宣邑 矿场 worth it? 80金+5木 → 1 ore/turn = 4 gold/turn, and ore is needed for 装备厂/补给厂 inputs. Yes, build it.\n\nNow, one more consideration: should I build the 兵营 hub on 碧庭 (29,24) which is at the east edge, adjacent to (29,23),(29,25),(30,24),(30,25),(29,26),(28,25)... good for expansion east. Fine.\n\nLet me do the builds. Note: 每地块每回合限建1座 — my 5 builds are on 5 different tiles. Good.\n\nThen spy on 秦? Let me check countries panel first to see if there's any useful info (distance, relations). Let me query countries and then decide.\n\nI'll batch: 5 build calls + countries query in one block (independent).",
