            "reasoning_content": "Now, decide on spying. 100 gold each. Both are non-bordering. Info value now: moderate. I think spying on one (秦) to learn their economy pattern and get their map. Actually the map from a spy could show me more of the world — useful for planning expansion direction (which wastelands are near them, whether we'll collide). Collisions with neighbors matter a lot: if 秦 is expanding toward the same wasteland region, I might need to plan war/alliance.\n\nI'll spy on both = 200 gold. Hmm, that's 17% of my treasury. Let me do just one now (秦), and 齐 later when relevant. Actually, knowing both is symmetric-value; but the money could build 3 farms. The info arrives turn 4 (3 turns later) — at that time I'd be about to start expanding, and knowing whether a neighbor is military-heavy is valuable for timing. I'll spy on 秦 only for now... \n\nHmm, let me think about which direction my expansion goes. My tiles are around (27-29, 23-25). Wasteland ring covers 26-30. Neighbors' positions unknown. If I spy on both, I learn the whole local geography via their maps. I think it's worth 200 gold once, early. Let's do both.\n\nActually, wait. Let me reconsider: does spy reveal their map including resource info of tiles? Probably terrain + owner + garrison. That tells me where their border is and which wastelands they're grabbing. That's real strategic info for expansion planning. 200 gold out of 1185 is OK given I have no gold income... hmm, no gold income means every gold spent is irreversible unless I sell goods. Let me be more frugal: spy on one. I'll pick 秦 (arbitrarily, but both are equally unknown). Hmm.\n\nActually, maybe better: use share_map with a neighbor? No—they don't border me, and share_map requires a target; it costs 10 gold and reveals my map to them, possibly they reciprocate. But I have nothing to offer and it exposes my weakness (0 army).\n\nLet me do one spy on 秦 (100金), keep 1085.\n\nThen plan (国策) and end_turn.\n\nLet me write a solid 国策:\n\n经济发展: 以农木为基（碧庭/云谷农场、岚栅/苍堰林场、宣邑矿场），优先把碧庭堆成军事-工业枢纽（3位后建兵营，配木材能源厂供电）；国库无金矿收入，靠卖余粮/余木换金，量入为出，保留≥400金应急。\n军事: 第4回合碧庭兵营落成、第5回合起每回合征1步兵；先清周边弱防野人（2军打1野人，减少战损），逐步占领荒地，优先探明并抢占含黄金资源的地块；装备靠市场购入（5/军），粮靠农场+买粮。\n情报: 间谍刺探秦（3回合后到），视情况再探齐；关注边界动向。\n外交: 暂保中立，不与秦齐接壤前不结盟不宣战；若接壤则先试探共同防御；被攻击则求和或结盟自救。\n\nThen end_turn.",
