            "reasoning_content": "Turn 4 done. Treasury 263, wood 5. At settlement: farms +4 food, lumber +4 wood, mine +1 ore, 能源厂 burns 1 wood → net wood +3 → 8. Food 30, ore 13, gold 263.\n\nTurn 5: recruit 1 infantry (10粮+5装) → 20 food, 0 equipment. Then attack? The army spawns at 碧庭. I need 2 armies to attack a primitive tile safely. With 1 army, attacking a plain primitive (0% def): my 50 dmg kills? No: primitive has 100HP. I deal 50, it deals 50 → I'd be at 50HP, it at 50. Next turn I deal 50 → it dies, I take 50 → 0HP = dead. So single-army attacks are suicidal. Wait for 2 armies (T5 and T6) then attack T7? Or attack with 1 army at T6 alongside the second (2 armies).\n\nActually: recruit army#1 at T5, army#2 at T6 (need 5 equipment: buy ~41-45金). Then T6 attack with both armies on (29,23) or (29,25).\n\nHmm, at T6 both armies are at 碧庭; attack adjacent tile (29,23)P or (29,25)F or (30,24)H or (28,24)... wait (28,24) is my own 云谷. Adjacent wasteland to 碧庭(29,24): (29,23)P, (29,25)F, (30,24)H, (30,25)P, (28,25) is mine, (28,23),(28,24),(29,23)... So attack (29,23) plain — best (no terrain defense bonus).\n\nCash at T6: 263 + income... gold income is 0 (no gold mine, no 市政厅). So 263 - 45 (equipment) = 218. Supply consumption: T6 settlement 2 armies → -2 supply (10 → 8).\n\nAlso 补给厂 (200金+12木) — I'd like one, but cash is 218 and I need wood too. Maybe T7 after capturing land.\n\nActually, note that supplies matter: 10 in stock, 2 armies = 2/turn → 5 turns of runway. Fine.\n\nEquipment purchases: each army needs 5 equipment (40金) + 10 food (20金 equiv). So each army costs ~60 gold in materials if buying equipment. That's the price of expansion. Each captured tile with gold deposit = +10/turn forever.\n\nLet me also think: should I sell food to raise gold? Food 26 → after recruiting 16. Farm income 4/turn. I'll need food for recruits (10/army) and 补给厂. Keep.\n\nCan I sell wood? Only 8. No.\n\nSo my gold is depleting: 263. Income sources: none in gold. I must sell surplus production (food/wood/ore) to fund, or capture gold.\n\nRealistically: capture 1 tile/turn starting T6-T7. If a captured tile has gold deposits, build 黄金矿场 (200金+10木) → +10金/turn.\n\nIf no gold in nearby tiles, I'll have to rely on selling goods.\n\nLet me end turn 4 now.\n\nActually, one thought: should I build 补给厂 instead of recruiting more armies? No — expansion first.\n\nAlso should I consider 城堡? Not now.\n\nEnd turn.",
