nt kill. On forest (10,26) I deal 50/1.1 = 45.5 each = 91 → barbarian survives with 9HP, and I take another 25 each → next turn finish it. So plains is much better. Attack (10,27)P.\n\nAlso (8,27)H is hills (+25%) — worse.\n\nSo: attack (10,27) with armies 1&2.\n\nLet me double check adjacency from (9,27): (10,27) dx=1, dy=0 → adjacent ✓.\n\nFinal turn 13 actions:\n1. sell ore 5 → +14 (26)\n2. buy supply 3 → -17 (9), warehouse 5\n3. attack (10,27) with [1,2]\n4. end turn\n\nWait, one more: is it worth also selling 4 wood (9 each... price 1.9 → 7.6)? I need wood for 补给厂 (12) and I have 9 + 2/turn income. Keep wood.\n\nFood: 19, price 1.2 — hold.\n\nOK go.",
