              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "role": "tool",
            "tool_call_id": "call_a62189f30dbe46dc9827ba50",
            "content": "购入 补给×2（市价 5.8→5.9 实付 12），余6"
          },
          {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "【刷新】你齐 国库75 粮7 木11 矿0 油0 装0 补给仓6 | 军队2 | 收信0 | 关系:秦=中立  楚=中立 | 近讯见 events。继续你的行动，做完了调 end_turn。"
          },
          {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "",
            "reasoning_content": "I've got 75 gold and 6 supply points, which should last 3 turns. My armies are engaged in combat at position (11,29) and will secure that tile by end of turn, though they'll be weakened to around 40/43 strength. I'm holding off on building anything else right now since I'm saving up for the supply facility.",
            "tool_calls": [
              {
                "id": "call_7f3c5225ecb84a4cb59230b6",
                "type": "function",
                "function": {
                  "name": "end_turn",
                  "arguments": "{\"summary\": \"第19回合：修订国策第3期（首目标=200金的补给厂，先止血补给外购，矿场延后），卖矿16金、两军南下攻(11,29)平原（回合末应取地），买补给2（仓6），国库75。\"}"
                }
